READ ME for folder "scenarios"
Author: Rebecca Chisholm, La Trobe University, 2026

This folder contains files to run all of the scenarios for figures 3-5 in the 
manuscript.

First, run: Simulate_all_scenarios.R

This will save an RData file in the folder "outputs" for each scenario 
considered, with specific
- Annual biting rate (3 values)
- Ivermectin vs Moxidectin
- Annual vs biannual MDA
- Using the original model parameterisation or the sensitivity analysis

Next, run: process_output.R

This will load each of the files and create two data frames (one for the 
original model parameterisation, df, and the other for the sensitivity analysis,
dfSA), and save them in the file "processed_outputs.RData"

Then, run: create_figures.R

This will load "processed_outputs.RData" and create figures 3-5 and their 
corresponding versions from the sensitivity analysis, and save them in the 
folder "figures"

Then, run: create_tables.R

This will load "processed_outputs.RData" and create tables for the supp, and 
save them in the folder "tables"

There is an additional script to run a single realisation of the model for a given 
parameterisation, and produce some plots of the output.  This is: run_once.R
